   "text": "Thanks, Owen, you're verified. I can see that one of the two beef phos ($15.00 each) is missing from the order. The handoff was in person at 6:41 PM, so this is within the reporting window. You can choose either of these:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. That's the $15.00 pho minus its $3.00 share of your WELCOME10 promo discount. The $3.00 share is added to your Forkful account as credit, so you'd get $12.00 on the card and $3.00 in credit.\n2. **Account credit only:** $18.00, which is the pho's price plus 20%. You can use it on a future order.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
