   "text": "Yes, that makes sense, Owen. WELCOME10 took $10.00 off your $50.00 subtotal. The missing pho is $15.00, which is 30% of the subtotal, so its share of the discount is $3.00. Here's what I've done:\n\n- **$12.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n- **$3.00 credited** to your Forkful account. This is the pho's share of the promo discount. Policy requires it to be returned as credit rather than to the card.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
